---
description: Core implementation and test conventions for this demo.
globs: "{src,test}/**/*.mjs"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use ES modules and named exports.
- Keep functions pure; do not add I/O to domain modules.
- Return plain objects and preserve existing public shapes.
- Tests use `node:test` and `node:assert/strict` with behavior-focused names.
- Run the narrowest affected test file before the complete `node --test` suite.
- Prefer explicit cases over a new abstraction until at least three call sites need it.

